    rdfs:subClassOf mtc-cnstr:EquipmentTimer ;
    skos:definition """time that a piece of equipment is performing any activity the equipment is active and performing a function under load or not.\n\nExample: For traditional machine tools, this includes `LOADED`, plus rapid moves, tool changes, etc.""" ;
